Assistant: I understand the error. The issue is that we're trying to reassign the `trpc` constant which is not allowed in JavaScript. Instead of reassigning `trpc`, we should mock the functionality we need in a different way. Let me fix this.

<file path="apps/web/.temp/dessn-component-routes/PasswordViewWrapper-5b7ed519.tsx">
  <change>
    <description>Replace direct trpc assignment with proper mocking and context provider</description>
